{"publicId":"483ea104-064f-4b2e-85c5-f3caadb7e8d9","title":"Menin-MLL互作抑制剂研究进展：Revumenib等药物在白血病模型中显效","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T05:26:04.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T05:26:04.000Z","digest":"AbMole于2026-11-10发表综述，指出Revumenib（SNDX-5613）作为选择性Menin-MLL结合抑制剂，在小鼠口服给药后对KMT2A重排急性白血病模型显示超过50%的症状缓解。该研究同时梳理了VTP50469和MI-503等同类抑制剂在APL、T-ALL等不同白血病亚型中的实验数据，证实Menin-MLL蛋白互作是白血病治疗的新靶点。需注意所有结论均基于小鼠实验，尚未涉及人体临床试验。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T12:10:31.323Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Menin-MLL互作抑制剂综述：从MI-2到Revumenib","latestReport":{"id":"pzddo2u00m3ui3o3l9r12oqox"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fBoFGUkFWJAk","title":"AbMole 综述丨 Menin-MLL互作抑制剂保姆级详解：从 MI-2 到Revumenib","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T05:26:04.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"pzddo2u00m3ui3o3l9r12oqox","title":"Menin-MLL互作抑制剂综述：从MI-2到Revumenib","summary":"Revumenib（SNDX-5613）是一种选择性Menin-MLL结合抑制剂，对小鼠口服给药后在KMT2A重排急性白血病样本中观察到超过50%的小鼠症状缓解。VTP50469和MI-503等其他抑制剂也在不同白血病模型中表现出显著疗效，为治疗急性白血病提供了新的药物选择。","source":{"name":"科学网博客","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T05:26:04.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"pzddo2u00m3ui3o3l9r12oqox","title":"Menin-MLL互作抑制剂综述：从MI-2到Revumenib","summary":"Revumenib（SNDX-5613）是一种选择性Menin-MLL结合抑制剂，对小鼠口服给药后在KMT2A重排急性白血病样本中观察到超过50%的小鼠症状缓解。VTP50469和MI-503等其他抑制剂也在不同白血病模型中表现出显著疗效，为治疗急性白血病提供了新的药物选择。","source":{"name":"科学网博客","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T05:26:04.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T16:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T17:00:00.000Z","heat":7.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":6.8,"participants":1}